+
+Request: a public helper `importTasks(list, text)`, exported from `src/index.ts`, for bulk import from spreadsheets.
+
+- Each line of `text` is `title;priority;tags`; an empty priority means normal; tags are separated by spaces. Blank lines are skipped.
+- Every valid line is added to the list. Returns `{ imported, rejected }`: `imported` counts the tasks added, `rejected` lists `{ line, reason }` (line counted from 1, blank lines included) for each line that could not be added.
+- Validation is the list's own (`add`), so its reasons are reused; a line with more than three fields is also rejected.
+- Implemented in `src/domain/import.ts`, tested in `test/import.test.ts`.
